    "updated_at": "2022-08-06T13:07:17Z",
    "body": "Aha.   What surprised me was that \"resolving\" (invoked by reference there) wasn't in the resolve() definition -- and \"resolving\" is only referenced from resolve() (and from itself).   Perhaps it should just be moved to resolve()...",
