    "updated_at": "2023-01-06T23:23:50Z",
    "body": "It seems reasonable to move it within the `resolve()` method algorithm since it's only referenced there... though I expect we may need to re-using this definition in some upcoming work, in which case we'd have to move the definition back to where it is now. I personally don't think it's worth the effort, but if you put up a PR to move the definition I'm happy to approve it.",
